{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_22", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_22.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "2nd Citizen.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, I expect he must be in the wrong this time, because neither the Householders\u2019 Association nor the Citizens\u2019 Club would lend him their hall for his meeting.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "1st Citizen.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "He couldn\u2019t even get the loan of the hall at the Baths.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "2nd Citizen.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "No, I should think not.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "A Man in another part of the crowd.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "I say\u2014who are we to back up in this?", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "Another Man, beside him.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Watch Aslaksen, and do as he does.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing (pushing his way through the crowd, with a writing-case under his arm).", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Excuse me, gentlemen\u2014do you mind letting me through?", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "I am reporting for the \u201cPeople\u2019s Messenger.\u201d", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Thank you very much!", "para": 5, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "(He sits down at the table on the left.)", "para": 5, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "A Workman.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Who was that?", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Second Workman.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Don\u2019t you know him?", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "It\u2019s Billing, who writes for Aslaksen\u2019s paper.", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "(CAPTAIN HORSTER brings in MRS. STOCKMANN and PETRA through the door on the right.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "EJLIF and MORTEN follow them in.)", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "I thought you might all sit here; you can slip out easily from here, if things get too lively.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you think there will be a disturbance?", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "One can never tell\u2014with such a crowd.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "But sit down, and don\u2019t be uneasy.", "para": 11, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann (sitting down).", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "It was extremely kind of you to offer my husband the room.", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, if nobody else would\u2014", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra (who has sat down beside her mother).", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "And it was a plucky thing to do, Captain Horster.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, it is not such a great matter as all that.", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "(HOVSTAD and ASLAKSEN make their way through the crowd.)", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen (going up to HORSTER).", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "Has the Doctor not come yet?", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "He is waiting in the next room.", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "(Movement in the crowd by the door at the back.)", "para": 18, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Look\u2014here comes the Mayor!", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, I\u2019m damned if he hasn\u2019t come after all!", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "(PETER STOCKMANN makes his way gradually through the crowd, bows courteously, and takes up a position by the wall on the left.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "Shortly afterwards Dr. STOCKMANN comes in by the right-hand door.", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "He is dressed in a black frock-coat, with a white tie.", "para": 21, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "There is a little feeble applause, which is hushed down.", "para": 21, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "Silence is obtained.)", "para": 21, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (in an undertone).", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "How do you feel, Katherine?", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "All right, thank you.", "para": 23, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "(Lowering her voice.)", "para": 23, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "Be sure not to lose your temper, Thomas.", "para": 23, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, I know how to control myself.", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "(Looks at his watch, steps on to the platform, and bows.", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "It is a quarter past\u2014so I will begin.", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "(Takes his MS. out of his pocket).", "para": 25, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "I think we ought to elect a chairman first.", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "No, it is quite unnecessary.", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "Some of the Crowd.", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes\u2014yes!", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "I certainly think too that we ought to have a chairman.", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "But I have called this meeting to deliver a lecture, Peter.", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann\u2019s lecture may possibly lead to a considerable conflict of opinion.", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "Voices in the Crowd.", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "A chairman!", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "A chairman !", "para": 32, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "The general wish of the meeting seems to be that a chairman should be elected.", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (restraining himself).", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "Very well\u2014let the meeting have its way.", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Will the Mayor be good enough to undertake the task ?", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "Three Men (clapping their hands).", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "Bravo!", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "Bravo!", "para": 36, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "For various reasons, which you will easily understand, I must beg to be excused.", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "But fortunately we have amongst us a man who I think will be acceptable to you all.", "para": 37, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "I refer to the President of the Householders' Association, Mr. Aslaksen.", "para": 37, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "Several voices.", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes\u2014Aslaksen!", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "Bravo Aslaksen!", "para": 38, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "(DR. STOCKMANN takes up his MS. and walks up and down the platform.)", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "Since my fellow-citizens choose to entrust me with this duty, I cannot refuse.", "para": 40, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "(Loud applause.", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "ASLAKSEN mounts the platform.)", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing (writing), \"Mr. Aslaksen was elected with enthusiasm.\"", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 102, "kind": "action", "text": "And now, as I am in this position, I should like to say a few brief words.", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 103, "kind": "action", "text": "I am a quiet and peaceable man, who believes in discreet moderation, and\u2014and\u2014in moderate discretion.", "para": 43, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 104, "kind": "action", "text": "All my friends can bear witness to that.", "para": 43, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 105, "kind": "action", "text": "Several Voices.", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 106, "kind": "action", "text": "That's right!", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 107, "kind": "action", "text": "That's right, Aslaksen!", "para": 44, "sent": 2, "present": []}]}